{#
    NOVA Single Page — src/views/pages/page-single.twig
    Confirmed exact filename (github.com/SallaApp/theme-raed's directory
    listing: src/views/pages/page-single.twig) — corrected from an earlier
    guess of "page.twig". Confirmed (docs.salla.dev/422556m0): this is
    Salla's unified mechanism for arbitrary merchant content (About Us,
    Policies, etc.) — 05-Pages.md's separate per-topic templates don't
    exist as distinct Salla routes.

    `page.title`/`page.content` assumed by analogy with confirmed
    `page.title` on other templates — not separately confirmed.
#}

{% extends "layouts.master" %}

{% block content %}
    <div class="nova-container nova-single-page">
        <h1 class="nova-single-page__title">{{ page.title }}</h1>
        <div class="nova-single-page__content">
            {{ page.content | raw }}
        </div>
    </div>
{% endblock %}
